---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Downloads from '../components/Downloads.astro';
import { site, url } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="A better workspace is on its way"
  description="Find release availability, installation instructions and complete source information for ENG Drawing Viewer."
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="section-tag">GET ENG DRAWING VIEWER</div>
      <h1>
        A better workspace.
        <br />
        <span>Yours, for free.</span>
      </h1>
      <p>
        The first public release is being prepared. Choose your platform below
        for the current status. No account, subscription or cloud workspace
        required.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="page-content">
      <Downloads />
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Ready when it’s ready.</h2>
        <p>
          The Mac application and complete corresponding source will become
          downloadable together after the release review. Windows is being
          rebuilt for ordinary PCs. No application packages are publicly
          available yet.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href={`${site.repo}/issues`}>
            Follow development or ask a question on GitHub ↗
          </a>
        </p>
        <h2>Installing on a Mac</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>
            When the release is available, download the Apple silicon DMG.
          </li>
          <li>
            Open the disk image and drag ENG Drawing Viewer into Applications.
          </li>
          <li>
            Open the application. Public requirements and checksums will be
            listed with the release.
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p>
          The first release is expected to use ad-hoc signing without Apple
          notarization. If macOS blocks it, confirm the source and checksum
          before using System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway. Do
          not disable Gatekeeper globally.
        </p>
        <h2>Verify a download</h2>
        <p>
          Every published asset will have a SHA-256 checksum. On macOS, run{' '}
          <code>shasum -a 256 "downloaded-file.dmg"</code>. On Windows, use{' '}
          <code>Get-FileHash "downloaded-file.zip" -Algorithm SHA256</code>.
          Compare the entire result with the release checksum.
        </p>
        <h2>Visiting from your phone?</h2>
        <p>
          This is a desktop application. Send this page to your computer when
          you’re ready.
        </p>
        <button class="button" data-share>
          Share this page ↗
        </button>
        <p data-share-status aria-live="polite"></p>
        <h2>Build it yourself</h2>
        <p>
          Complete source and build instructions will accompany the approved
          release under AGPL-3.0-or-later. The source download will be enabled
          above when that release is public.
        </p>
        <a href={url('support/')} class="text-link">
          Installation questions? Visit support ↗
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
